        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1\" Diameter Deco Shower Door Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful 1\" diameter cone shaped deco style glass shower door knob depict a minimalism retro look. Single knob kits are normally used on sliding glass shower doors but can also be used on one side of a swing glass door. They have a matching finish screw cover for a clean looking installation.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-DECO1-size.gif?v=1704354617\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deco Shower Door Knob Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/deco-shower-door-knob-pair-sd-deco2\"><b>Deco Shower Door Knob Pair</b></a> and matching <a href=\"/products/deco-cabinet-knob\"><b>Deco Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use. Available in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deco Shower Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Cover  Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 1 deco knob, screw cover and all the hardware for installation on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Each (1 Knob - for one side of a glass door)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Deco Shower Door Knob",
                "description": "This beautiful 1 inch diameter cone shaped deco style glass shower door knob depict a minimalism retro look. These single knob kit is normally used on sliding glass shower doors but can also be used on one side of a swing glass door. Their solid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use. Available in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.",
